:: school.first-visit -> @exit
  @auto enter-place
  @place-key high_school
  @when not flags.high_school.first_visit_seen
  @priority 1000
  @onenter
    @effect set flags.high_school.first_visit_seen
  @endonenter

  You pause inside the entrance as students move around you with the confidence of people who already know where they are going. Classroom signs point deeper into the building, and notices point towards the student council office.

  [info]The school's Current Activities section shows what is happening now. Attending class records your attendance and can improve that subject. The weekly timetable is posted in the student council office, while your grades and total attendance are available through Player stats on your phone.[/info]

  You are not locked into the school day. You can attend the current lesson, explore the building, wait for the schedule to advance, or leave.

  @choice "Look around" -> @exit
    @event-pool school.traversal
  @endchoice


:: school.taylor.first-meeting -> @exit
  @place-key high_school
  @auto enter-place
  @priority 500
  @when school.phase != "class" and npc.taylor.present
  @when not npc.taylor.met
  @onenter
    @effect relationship taylor.friendship 1
  @endonenter

  Taylor is standing near the lockers, watching the crowd between lessons. When {{npc.taylor.subject}} notices you looking, {{npc.taylor.subject}} gives you a small, uncertain smile.

  "You're new, right?" {{npc.taylor.subject}} asks. "I'm Taylor."

  You introduce yourself. The conversation is brief, but Taylor seems relieved to recognise one more person in the crowded school.

  @next "See you around" -> @exit

:: school.taylor.first-meeting.traversal -> @return
  @place-key high_school
  @pool school.traversal
  @priority 500
  @when school.phase != "class" and npc.taylor.present
  @when not npc.taylor.met
  @onenter
    @effect relationship taylor.friendship 1
  @endonenter

  Taylor is standing near the lockers, watching the crowd between lessons. When {{npc.taylor.subject}} notices you looking, {{npc.taylor.subject}} gives you a small, uncertain smile.

  "You're new, right?" {{npc.taylor.subject}} asks. "I'm Taylor."

  You introduce yourself. The conversation is brief, but Taylor seems relieved to recognise one more person in the crowded school.

  @next "See you around" -> @return

:: place.high-school
  @hub high_school
  @choices "Travel"

  @choicegroup "Current Activities"

    @if school.phase == "before_school"

      The halls of {{place.name}} are open, though lessons have not begun yet. You can see groups of students move in the hallways.

      @choice "Wait for the first class" -> @exit

        @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
      @endchoice

    @elseif school.phase == "class" and school.subjectId == "english"

      English class is in progress. You can still attend or keep exploring the school.

      @choice "Attend English class" -> school.class.english

      @endchoice

    @elseif school.phase == "class" and school.subjectId == "math"

      Mathematics class is in progress. You can still attend or keep exploring the school.

      @choice "Attend Mathematics class" -> school.class.math

      @endchoice

    @elseif school.phase == "class" and school.subjectId == "history"

      History class is in progress. You can still attend or keep exploring the school.

      @choice "Attend History class" -> school.class.history

      @endchoice

    @elseif school.phase == "lunch"

      Lunch break is underway. The cafeteria is open until afternoon classes begin.

      @choice "Go to the cafeteria" -> @exit

        @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
      @endchoice

      @choice "Wait for the next class" -> @exit

        @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
      @endchoice

    @elseif school.phase == "class" and school.subjectId == "science"

      Science class is in progress. You can still attend or keep exploring the school.

      @choice "Attend Science class" -> school.class.science

      @endchoice

    @elseif school.phase == "class" and school.subjectId == "art"

      Art class is in progress. You can still attend or keep exploring the school.

      @choice "Attend Art class" -> school.class.art

      @endchoice

    @elseif school.phase == "class" and school.subjectId == "physical_education"

      Physical education is in progress. You can still attend or keep exploring the school.

      @choice "Attend Physical Education" -> school.class.physical-education

      @endchoice

    @elseif school.phase == "break"

      There is a short break before the next class begins.

      @choice "Go to the cafeteria" -> @exit

        @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
      @endchoice

      @choice "Wait for the next class" -> @exit

        @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
      @endchoice

    @elseif school.phase == "after_school"

      Lessons are over, but {{place.name}} remains open until 17:00.

      @choice "Stay until school closes" -> @exit

        @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
      @endchoice

    @elseif school.phase == "no_school"

      There are no lessons today, though the administrative areas remain open.

      @choice "Visit the school office" -> @exit
        @icon 🏫
        @time 15m
      @endchoice

      @choice "Read the school notices" -> @exit
        @icon 📌
        @time 5m
      @endchoice

    @else

      The school has closed for the day.

    @endif

  @endchoicegroup

  @choicegroup "Activities"

    @choice "Go to the cafeteria" -> place.high-school.cafeteria
      @icon 🍽️
      @time 1m
      @event-pool school.traversal
    @endchoice

    @choice "Go to the math classroom" -> place.high-school.math-classroom
      @icon 🧮
      @time 1m
      @event-pool school.traversal
    @endchoice

    @choice "Go to the english classroom" -> place.high-school.english-classroom
      @icon 📖
      @time 1m
      @event-pool school.traversal
    @endchoice

    @choice "Go to the history classroom" -> place.high-school.history-classroom
      @icon 📜
      @time 1m
      @event-pool school.traversal
    @endchoice

    @choice "Go to the science classroom" -> place.high-school.science-classroom
      @icon 🔬
      @time 2m
      @event-pool school.traversal
    @endchoice

    @choice "Go to the art classroom" -> place.high-school.art-classroom
      @icon 🎨
      @time 2m
      @event-pool school.traversal
    @endchoice

    @choice "Go to the school gym" -> place.high-school.gym
      @icon 🏃
      @time 5m
      @event-pool school.traversal
    @endchoice

    @choice "Go to the school nurse's office" -> school.caro.first-meeting
      @icon 🏥
      @time 2m
      @when npc.caro.present and not npc.caro.met and school.phase != "class"
      @event-pool school.traversal
    @endchoice

    @choice "Go to the school nurse's office" -> place.high-school.nurse-office
      @icon 🏥
      @time 2m
      @when not npc.caro.present or npc.caro.met or school.phase == "class"
      @event-pool school.traversal
    @endchoice

    @choice "Visit the student council office" -> place.high-school.student-council-room
      @icon 🏫
      @time 5m
      @event-pool school.traversal
    @endchoice

  @endchoicegroup

:: school.class.english -> @exit
  @behavior school.class {"subject":"english"}
  @choices "Class activity"

  @passage segment-1

  The students fill the classroom and take their seats. The teacher begins the lesson, and you focus on the material.

  @choice "Chat with Taylor" -> .segment-2

    @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
    @event-pool school.class.english

    @when npc.taylor.present and npc.taylor.met
    @effect attendance english 1
    @effect add story.npc.taylor.school_interactions 1
    @change relationship taylor.friendship 1
  @endchoice

  @choice "Study hard" -> .segment-2

    @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
    @event-pool school.class.english

    @effect attendance english 1
    @change grade english 1
  @endchoice

  @passage segment-2

  The teacher continues the lesson, and you take notes diligently. The class is going well so far.

  @choice "Chat with Taylor" -> .segment-3
    @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
    @event-pool school.class.english
    @when npc.taylor.present and npc.taylor.met
    @effect attendance english 1
    @effect add story.npc.taylor.school_interactions 1
    @change relationship taylor.friendship 1
  @endchoice

  @choice "Study hard" -> .segment-3
    @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
    @event-pool school.class.english

    @effect attendance english 1
    @change grade english 1
  @endchoice

  @passage segment-3

  The students look bored as the teacher wraps up the lesson. You have a few minutes before the class ends.

  @choice "Chat with Taylor" -> @exit

    @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
    @event-pool school.class.english
    @when npc.taylor.present and npc.taylor.met
    @effect attendance english 1
    @effect add story.npc.taylor.school_interactions 1
    @change relationship taylor.friendship 1
  @endchoice

  @choice "Study hard" -> @exit

    @time-until school.nextBoundaryAt
    @event-pool school.class.english

    @effect attendance english 1
    @change grade english 1
  @endchoice

