  @if school.phase == "lunch" or school.phase == "break"
    The gym is open, and students are exercising and socialising.
  @elseif school.phase == "class"
    Everyone looks at you as you enter the gym. The teacher is at the front of the room, and students are exercising.
  @else
    There's a lone student here practicing basketball.
  @endif

  @choice "Wait for class" -> school.class.physical-education

    @time-until school.nextClassStartsAt
    @when school.phase != "class" and school.nextClass == "physical_education"
  @endchoice

  @choice "Leave" -> @exit
    @time 5m
    @event-pool school.traversal
  @endchoice

:: place.high-school.student-council-room

  @if school.phase == "after_school"
    "Yes?" the student council president asks as they look up from their paperwork.
  @elseif school.phase == "class"
    Nobody answers your knock. The office is closed during class time.
  @else
    There's nobody here.
  @endif

  @choice "View the weekly timetable" -> school.weekly-timetable
  @endchoice

  @choice "Leave" -> @exit
    @time 5m
    @event-pool school.traversal
  @endchoice

:: school.weekly-timetable -> place.high-school.student-council-room
  @heading "Weekly timetable"
  @choices "Timetable"
  @system school.timetable

:: school.caro.first-meeting -> place.high-school.nurse-office
  @heading "The school nurse"
  @onenter
    @effect relationship caro.rapport 1
    @effect set flags.npc.caro.school_encountered
  @endonenter

  The nurse's office smells faintly of disinfectant and peppermint tea. The woman behind the desk puts down her pen when you enter.

  "You must be the new student," she says. "Caro Novak. School nurse, keeper of ice packs, and the person people visit when they want permission to lie down for ten minutes."

  You introduce yourself. Caro repeats your name once, committing it to memory, then gestures towards the chair opposite her desk.

  @next "Nice to meet you" -> place.high-school.nurse-office

:: place.high-school.nurse-office

  @if npc.caro.present
    @if school.phase == "class"
      Nobody answers your knock. The office is closed during class time.
    @else
      Nurse Caro looks up from {{npc.caro.dependent}} paperwork.
    @endif
  @else
    The office is empty. You can see the nurse's chair pushed back from the desk.
  @endif

  @choice "Ask the school nurse for a checkup" -> place.high-school.nurse-office
    @time 2m
    @when npc.caro.present and school.phase != "class"
    @response
      The nurse looks you over and takes your vitals. "Everything looks good," {{npc.caro.subject}} says, "but make sure to get enough sleep and eat well!"
    @endresponse
  @endchoice

  @choice "Leave" -> @exit
    @time 2m
    @event-pool school.traversal
  @endchoice
